e preserved, waypoints stay within map bounds and finite, maintain obstacle clearance based on safety distance, and do not exceed the maximum allowed waypoints. The objective minimizes weighted sum of path length, collision penalty, risk exposure, smoothness penalty, and number of waypoints. Risk exposure is computed per zone with a local weight, while the global risk objective weight scales the total risk term.","inputs":["width","height","start","goal","obstacles","risk_zones","safety_distance","seed","objective_weights","grid_resolution","max_waypoints"],"objective":"Minimize the total cost: objective_weights.length * total_path_length + objective_weights.collision * collision_penalty + objective_weights.risk * total_risk_exposure + objective_weights.smoothness * smoothness_penalty + objective_weights.waypoint * number_of_waypoints. Collision penalty is high if obstacle clearance is violated (safety distance not met). Smoothness penalty encourages straight path (e.g., sum of squared turning angles). Total risk exposure is sum over risk zones of (zone.weight * measure of path length inside that zone), where zone.weight is the local risk weight from the zone definition.","output":"Ordered list of 2D waypoints defining the path from start to goal, e.g., [[x1,y1], [x2,y2], ...]. The path must be feasible, i.e., it must satisfy all constraints including start/end points, map bounds, obstacle clearance, finite coordinates, and waypoint limit.","problem_type":"STATIC_2D_UAV_PATH_PLANNING","source_hash":"dc4d564a6a7171680243b206f299d2797b2206f205f1e623c4da1e84c56701bc"},"provider":"deepseek","provider_calls":[{"attempts":1,"call_id":"llmcall_deepseek_000001","cumulative_total_tokens":1853,"error":null,"latency_ms":11746.683600002143,"model":"deepseek-v4-pro","output_model":"UAVProblemDescription","prompt_hash":"5f0960de06664fcbf1dae303ca3fb1ed5c47a44ac4af635d778c3c0136d6c335","prompt_version":"afl_uav_description_generator_v2","provider":"deepseek","request_hash":"29a71d